&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Familiarity with electrical component suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Familiarity with seeker technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience with high voltage interconnect systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience designing and scaling production of components at volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience developing or testing complex electrical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience with MIL-STD-704, MIL-STD-810, MIL-STD-461.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;Experience with explosive operations and/or handling munitions.&lt;/li&gt;
