&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW24461057 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW24461057 BCX0&quot;&gt;Apply today to join the team at Aviation Institute of Maintenance and help train the next generation of A&amp;amp;P mechanics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW24461057 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AIM&lt;/strong&gt; is a proud equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. We believe that a diverse workforce contributes to the success of our company and are dedicated to fostering a culture of respect, equity, and inclusion.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

