&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E288&quot;&gt;2+ years working on Financial Crime prevention products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E289&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E290&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
