&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E292&quot;&gt;Experience delivering high-performance systems in regulated environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E293&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E294&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E294&quot;&gt;Exposure to KYC/KYB, screening, transaction monitoring or fraud management tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E295&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;E296&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
